## 10. Advanced definitions

The expanded format is intended for reusable datapacks and advanced behavior.

```json
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "enabled": true,
  "trigger": {
    "type": "interval",
    "check_every_ticks": 1200,
    "cooldown_ticks": 24000,
    "chance": {
      "base": 0.05
    }
  },
  "conditions": {
    "dimensions": ["minecraft:overworld"]
  },
  "wave": {
    "radius": 40,
    "maximum_attempts_per_member": 32,
    "groups": [
      {
        "entity": "minecraft:pillager",
        "count": 5,
        "persistent": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Use the expanded format when the compact format cannot express what you need. The following sections cover the core airship and cannon fields; use the full documentation for every optional field and complex fleet behavior.

